From: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 23:25:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 99/99] goodix-fp-overlay: Breeze look, rotation, full
 brightness, restarts

- Breeze-style plate with an accent-coloured ring and the theme's
  fingerprint icon, following colour scheme and accent; static, drawn once
- small window over the sensor placed by layer-shell margins, at the
  physical sensor position for every output rotation (checked with touch
  probes at 0/90/180/270 degrees)
- full backlight through logind while a finger is on the sensor
  (10-25 ms), previous value afterwards
- fetches fprintd's current state at start and resets when fprintd goes
  away
- no Qt Wayland reconnect: exit and let systemd restart it
  (restart.conf), so the new surface gets the lock screen mark again
